<title>POLAND: KABLE NET SWINGS TO PROFIT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>KABLE NET SWINGS TO PROFIT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.15 vs   0.47 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.16 vs   0.47 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.28 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		   12.60 vs  12.44</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.48 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.49 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.21 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Sales		   70.84 vs  68.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Slaska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA. </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
